### ==================== TOURNAMENTS ====================

## Crea un torneo easy (richiede login)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/tournaments HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "difficulty": "easy"
}

###

## Crea un torneo medium (richiede login)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/tournaments HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "difficulty": "medium"
}

###

## Crea un torneo hard (richiede login)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/tournaments HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "difficulty": "hard"
}

###

## Crea un torneo con difficoltà non valida (422)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/tournaments HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "difficulty": "impossible"
}

###

## Join torneo esistente 
POST http://localhost:3001/api/tournaments/CODE/join HTTP/1.1

###

## Join torneo non esistente (404)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/tournaments/XXXXXX/join HTTP/1.1

###

### ==================== CASUAL GAME ====================

## Crea una partita casual easy (utente anonimo)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/games HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "difficulty": "easy"
}

###

## Crea una partita casual medium (utente anonimo)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/games HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "difficulty": "medium"
}

###

## Crea una partita casual con difficoltà non valida (422)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/games HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "difficulty": "impossible"
}

###

### ==================== SHOTS ====================

## Lancia un missile 
POST http://localhost:3001/api/games/ID/shots HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "row": 1,
    "col": 1
}

###

## Lancia un missile con coordinate non valide (422)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/games/ID/shots HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "row": 0,
    "col": 0
}

###

## Lancia un missile su cella già colpita (409)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/games/ID/shots HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "row": 1,
    "col": 1
}

###

### ==================== GAME STATE ====================

## Recupera lo stato della partita 
GET http://localhost:3001/api/games/ID HTTP/1.1

###

## Recupera lo stato di una partita non esistente (404)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/games/9999 HTTP/1.1

###

## Recupera le posizioni delle navi a fine partita 
GET http://localhost:3001/api/games/ID/ships HTTP/1.1

###

## Recupera le posizioni delle navi di una partita in corso (403)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/games/ID/ships HTTP/1.1

###

### ==================== STATS ====================

## Recupera le statistiche globali (pubblico, 200)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/stats HTTP/1.1

###


### ==================== CONFIG ====================

## Recupera la configurazione delle difficoltà (pubblico, 200)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/config HTTP/1.1

###